{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLTIwMTUvU2l4dGVlbiUyMCUyODIwMTMlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Sixteen","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/tkFCu56ai54XA6kifNe4u1Qop2U.jpg","description":"Jumah is about to turn 16 and is already in need of a fresh start. Burdened with the shameful legacy of a past as a child soldier in the Congo, he lives with his adoptive mother in west London, where he struggles to keep a lid on his history of violence. One night, enjoying a rare carefree evening out with a new friend, Jumah witnesses something that draws him seemingly inescapably into his old ways. As he and others around him begin to question whether he can ever stop being a soldier, he’s set on a path to find out who he truly wishes to be.","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["Thriller","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"3.0","runtime":"80 min","cast":["Roger Jean Nsengiyumva","Rachael Stirling","Fady Elsayed","Sam Spruell","Rosie Day","Christopher Simpson","Deon Lee-Williams"],"director":["Rob Brown"],"released":"2013-10-13T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Roger Jean Nsengiyumva","character":"Jumah","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mzgtoyaSK2N8Xl4BKb3rjzsnr8D.jpg"},{"name":"Rachael Stirling","character":"Laura","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ydX9vmJ4LJ5ptIAZ9v8SxH2Y3Zs.jpg"},{"name":"Fady Elsayed","character":"Josh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xeGwknsnjShTjF0RcduhwWiXnEA.jpg"},{"name":"Sam Spruell","character":"Liam","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5xQOHz3uUy20zsUMABaIsAXKFcI.jpg"},{"name":"Rosie Day","character":"Chloe","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/r20P9ZV22YLoGeTbp8TKSGTjfET.jpg"},{"name":"Christopher Simpson","character":"The Headmaster","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A9HIPi5qhLU9HwkkjdYvAgRWmGb.jpg"},{"name":"Deon Lee-Williams","character":"Alex"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"0170T5uuKOo","type":"Trailer"}],"trailerStreams":[{"title":"Trailer","ytId":"0170T5u